Not included, and not ours to license
-------------------------------------
- Dwarf Fortress (Bay 12 Games / Kitfox Games) and DFHack are never included. docker/Dockerfile builds an image from
  copies you download yourself. Don't publish an image built from it: the image contains the game.
- No Dwarf Fortress save files are included. Every start fort is rebuilt from a world seed by committed scripts
  (docs/SEED-FORTS.md). Redistribution terms for saves are unclear, so we don't ship any.
- df/prefs/init.txt and d_init.txt aren't shipped. docker/prefs_overrides.py writes them from your DF install's
  data/init/*_default.txt plus a few token edits.
- No agent trajectories, model outputs or fine-tuned adapters are included.
- The fixed model (z-ai/glm-5.3-flash) is a third-party hosted service under its provider's terms.

DFHack (https://github.com/DFHack/dfhack) is zlib-licensed. See DFHack's LICENSE.rst for its copyright holders and
bundled components. We ship only one DFHack config file (df/dfhack-config/remote-server.json), not DFHack itself.
